flowchart TB

 A["Replica A<br/>check every 1 min"]:::app
 B["Replica B<br/>check every 1 min"]:::app
 CLAIM["Atomic claim · MongoDB transaction<br/>readConcern snapshot · writeConcern majority<br/>not paused · nextRunAt due · lock free<br/>new runId · fetchSeq +1 · RUNNING<br/>lock 5 min · deadline 2 min<br/>nextRunAt = claim + 30 min"]:::data
 SKIP["No claim<br/>no provider request<br/>wait for next check"]:::ops
 HTTP["Winner calls AeroDataBox<br/>outside the transaction<br/>GKE source = aerodatabox<br/>(default: stub)"]:::public
 VALID["Validate whole batch<br/>1 invalid flight → reject all<br/>IATA destination override<br/>Terminal 2 · sort · first 36"]:::app
 TX["Publication transaction<br/>readConcern snapshot · writeConcern majority<br/>check lock owner + deadline<br/>only higher fetchSeq replaces board<br/>board + SUCCESS + release lock"]:::data
 FAIL["Failure<br/>keep last good board<br/>ERROR record · release own lock<br/>nextRunAt unchanged"]:::ops
 CTRL["fetch_control<br/>paused · nextRunAt · lock<br/>runDeadline · fetchSeq"]:::data
 BOARD["board_current<br/>one complete snapshot"]:::data
 RUNS["fetch_runs<br/>RUNNING / SUCCESS / ERROR<br/>TTL 7 days"]:::data
 A --> CLAIM
 B --> CLAIM
 CLAIM -->|one winner| HTTP
 CLAIM -->|no claim| SKIP
 HTTP -->|HTTP 200| VALID
 HTTP -->|error / timeout| FAIL
 VALID -->|valid, also empty| TX
 VALID -->|invalid| FAIL
 TX -->|guard / deadline / DB error| FAIL
 CLAIM -.-> CTRL
 CLAIM -.-> RUNS
 TX --> BOARD
 TX -.-> CTRL
 TX -.-> RUNS
 FAIL -.-> RUNS
 FAIL -.->|release own lock| CTRL

